--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Pre-trained checkpoints — redistributed unmodified
   Publisher: NeoQuasar (https://huggingface.co/NeoQuasar)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Kronos.Forecasting.Weights.* packages embed the following published checkpoints
verbatim. Each repository declares the MIT licence via its model-card metadata
(`license: mit`) but publishes no LICENCE file and states no separate copyright
holder, so there is no further notice to reproduce. The exact revisions
redistributed are recorded here and asserted at build time.

  Kronos.Forecasting.Weights.Small
    NeoQuasar/Kronos-small
      revision 901c26c1332695a2a8f243eb2f37243a37bea320
    NeoQuasar/Kronos-Tokenizer-base
      revision 0e0117387f39004a9016484a186a908917e22426

  Kronos.Forecasting.Weights.Mini
    NeoQuasar/Kronos-mini
      revision f4e68697d9d5aed55cef5c96aabc3376bcad9f81
    NeoQuasar/Kronos-Tokenizer-2k
      revision 26966d0035065a0cae0ebad7af8ece35bc1fb51c

The tokenizer checkpoints are published as separate repositories from the
models but by the same publisher under the same declared licence, so they need
no distinct treatment beyond being listed. A model and its tokenizer are not
independently valid and are always distributed as a pair.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Runtime dependency
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

TorchSharp and the libtorch native runtime are separate works under their own
licences, obtained through NuGet. Neither is redistributed here.

